  "item_short_desc": "<p>Be ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice with our Concealed Carry Spec Ops Fleece Jacket. Crafted with a heavyweight 100% polyester fleece material and tricot lining, the CCW jacket provides long-lasting warmth and comfort while offering best-in-class discrete carry through dual built-in padded pockets for quick and efficient access to your firearm. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay warm and prepared with this tactical fleece jacket.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Be ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice with our Concealed Carry Spec Ops Fleece Jacket. Crafted with a heavyweight 100% polyester fleece material and tricot lining, the CCW jacket provides long-lasting warmth and comfort while offering best-in-class discrete carry through dual built-in padded pockets for quick and efficient access to your firearm. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay warm and prepared with this tactical fleece jacket. CCW Design: Rothco&rsquo;s ambidextrous concealed carry pocket system features dual built-in padded pockets designed to safely and discretely holster firearms and personal accessories. In addition, each side features an internal mag pouch. Ready at a Moment&rsquo;s Notice: Our Spec Ops Discrete Carry Fleece Jacket features a heavyweight 100% polyester fleece material and tricot lining for long-lasting warmth and comfort while offering best-in-class discrete carry. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay warm and prepared with this concealed carry jacket. Combat the Cold: In addition to the warm fleece material, the mandarin collar of the coat provides extra cold weather protection while the internal main zipper flap and adjustable drawstring waist helps keep the heat in, and the cold out, by blocking the wind. Tactical Pockets: These cold weather jackets feature 2 front zipper slash pockets and 1 zipper chest pocket on the left for securing EDC essentials. Utility at the Forefront: The CCW fleece jacket features reinforced shoulder and outer forearm yokes for additional durability and performance. The foldout cuffs with built-in thumbholes keep your sleeves in place while preserving heat and maintaining range of motion. Any Mission, Any Time: Our rugged concealed carry jackets are great for field operations, outdoor excursions, everyday wear, and more. Whether you are a tactical operator, military personnel, or an avid adventurer, the Concealed Carry Spec Ops Fleece Jacket ensures that you remain at the ready.</p>",
